# The Pokémon Mansion (FireRed's MUS_POKE_MANSION, which the burned house and the abandoned Power Plant share): an
# uneasy, creeping piece in C minor, a lonely music-box line over plucked strings in a chromatic figure, held strings and
# a slow bass that steps down by halves, for empty rooms where something terrible was once made. A place indoors
# plays the same by day and night. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K6, part b).
title Pokémon Mansion
tempo 92
meter 4/4
reverb 0.48
night none

